  "心脏": "Heart",
  "心跳钟楼": "The Pulse Clock",
  "黄铜摆钟": "Brass pendulum clock",
  "一座小钟楼藏在胸腔深处。黄铜摆锤划过红色钟面，楼下的观众仰头等着下一拍。": "A little clock tower hides deep in the chest. A brass pendulum sweeps past a red clock face, while visitors below wait for the next beat.",
  "肺": "Lungs",
  "呼吸风琴厅": "Bellows Hall",
  "双翼管风琴": "Twin-wing pipe organ",
  "两叶展厅共用一组风箱。长短铜管沿肺叶排开，中央的风轮随呼吸缓缓转动。": "Two galleries share one set of bellows. Brass pipes of different lengths follow the lung lobes, while a central wheel turns slowly with each breath.",
  "肝脏": "Liver",
  "琥珀光廊": "The Amber Gallery",
  "一排可透光的琥珀标本": "A row of translucent amber specimens",
  "深赭色的展壁里嵌着三扇窗。每一块琥珀都立在自己的铜座上，微光穿过切面，落在回廊里。": "Three windows open in the dark ochre walls. Each amber specimen stands on its own brass base, casting a faint glow through its facets into the gallery.",
  "胃": "Stomach",
  "旋流陶坊": "The Churn Studio",
  "旋转的陶轮": "Turning pottery wheel",
  "弯曲的胃壁围出一间陶坊。陶轮上的青瓷罐缓缓旋转，旁边的架子陈列着烧成的器皿。": "The curved stomach walls enclose a pottery studio. A celadon vessel turns slowly on the wheel, beside shelves of finished ceramics.",
  "肾脏": "Kidneys",
  "双泉水务馆": "The Filter Works",
  "两座滤泉塔": "Twin filtering towers",
  "两座小塔接住从铜管落下的水珠。一座沉淀，一座澄清；两池之间，小栏杆给参观者留出一条窄窄的走道。": "Two little towers catch water from brass pipes. One settles it, the other clears it. A narrow railed walkway runs between their pools.",
  "肠道": "Intestines",
  "回廊档案馆": "The Coiled Archive",
  "折返的书库长廊": "Winding library corridors",
  "书架顺着肠道折成连续的回廊。一本本袖珍藏书沿弯道排开，楼梯尽头留了一盏小小的阅读灯。": "Bookshelves follow the intestines into a continuous arcade. Miniature volumes line the bends, with a little reading lamp at the top of the stairs.",
