  "又回到日常。": "and back again.",
  "电脑背后 · 立体空间验证": "Behind the Laptop · Spatial Study",
  "电脑背后，展开一座小岛": "An island unfolds behind the laptop",
  "立体景观迭代 · 海边观景书屋": "Spatial Landscape Study · Seaside Bookroom",
  "查看旧版与原照": "View the previous version and source photograph",
  "查看最新：洞窟、书屋与海湾整体生成版 →": "Latest: unified grotto, bookroom, and bay →",
  "下层是海湾，上层是一座观景书屋：石拱廊里藏着书架与长椅，铜色穹顶、瓦屋顶和木露台组成新的轮廓。屏幕后仰约25°，可切到侧面查看建筑深度，或与上一版对比。": "A bay below and a reading room above. Bookshelves and benches sit in a stone arcade, with a copper dome, tiled roof, and wooden terrace forming its silhouette. The screen tilts back about 25 degrees; turn to the side to inspect its depth or compare the previous version.",
  "打开房门，进入海风书屋 →": "Open the door and enter the Sea Breeze Bookroom →",
  "背面俯看": "Back overhead view",
  "对比上一版": "Compare the previous version",
  "电脑立体空间草模，可拖动和缩放": "Laptop spatial prototype. Drag to rotate and zoom.",
  "正在载入空间草模…": "Loading the spatial prototype…",
  "书屋由 Tripo H3.1 独立生成；下层海湾与灯塔沿用 Hi3D 资产，基座与步道在本地装配。屏幕倾角参照原照观感估计。": "The standalone bookroom was generated with Tripo H3.1. The lower bay and lighthouse reuse Hi3D assets; the base and paths were assembled locally. The screen tilt was estimated from the source photograph.",
  "书页化成层层白崖，石阶从海风小屋绕向水边；圆形瞭望亭隔着海湾，与小屋遥遥相望。": "Book pages become layers of white cliffs. Stone steps wind from a breezy cottage down to the water, with a round lookout across the bay.",
  "赤岩峡谷夹着一线碧水，木桥横跨两岸。沿石阶向上，进入有阴凉露台的峡湾旅舍。": "A ribbon of turquoise water runs through red rock cliffs, crossed by a wooden bridge. Follow the steps up to a canyon inn with a shaded terrace.",
  "银白边框里展开一片潮汐港。海水浴屋、船棚和栈道环绕浅湾，远端留下熟悉的三枚镜头。": "A tidal port unfolds within a silver frame. A bathhouse, boat shed, and boardwalk surround the shallow bay; three familiar camera lenses remain at the far end.",
  "正在载入": "Loading",
