  "新版为静态的背面展开态，保留完整建筑和地形纵深。与普通物件之间的收展、桌面位置及动态海水仍待接入。": "This version is a static unfolded back world, retaining complete buildings and terrain depth. Folding, desktop registration, and moving water still need integration in this study.",
