  "查看3D还原": "View 3D reconstruction",
  "原照在本机用 SAM 2.1 分割。电脑、椅子、台灯和书上小物件由 Hi3D 生成后校准；纸页和台灯材质经过修正。长臂灯、手机与耳机按原照补建；隐藏面仍有近似。": "The source photograph was segmented locally with SAM 2.1. Hi3D models of the laptop, chair, lamps, and book ornament were calibrated; paper and lamp materials were refined. The adjustable lamp, phone, and headphones follow the source photo. Hidden surfaces remain approximate.",
  "原照在本机用 SAM 2.1 分割，电脑由 Hi3D 生成后重新标定。书封保留原图纹理，桌面遮挡区经过补绘。": "The source photograph was segmented locally with SAM 2.1. A Hi3D laptop was recalibrated, book covers retain source textures, and occluded desktop areas were completed.",
  "原照在本机用 SAM 2.1 分割，电脑使用校准几何和原图纹理。Hi3D 景观与实时海水组成桌面假期。": "The source photograph was segmented locally with SAM 2.1. The laptop uses calibrated geometry and photo textures; miniature landscapes and real-time water create the holiday world.",
  "固定原照机位的三维还原对照。点击右下角按钮或按空格切换原照片和3D。": "Compare the 3D reconstruction from the original viewpoint. Use the lower-right button or Space to switch between photograph and 3D.",
