  "一张照片的背面": "The other side of a photograph",
  "绕过电脑，书页间藏着一座海边小屋。沿栈道走过去，蓝杯背后是一处港湾。台灯的暖光照着这片小小的假期。": "Behind the laptop, a seaside cottage hides between book pages. Follow its boardwalk to a harbor behind the blue cup. A desk lamp casts warm light over this little holiday.",
  "这是基于你提供的工位照片制作的交互样片。原图深度由模型估计；新露出的空间与微缩海岸经过人工设计，并非完整实景扫描。": "This interactive study is based on the supplied workspace photograph. Its depth is estimated; newly revealed spaces and miniature shores are designed, rather than a complete scan of the real scene.",
  "正在准备照片深度与 Hi3D 景观。": "Preparing photo depth and miniature landscapes.",
  "左右拖动、滚轮或双指缩放可控制进度。键盘方向键前进／后退，空格播放／暂停，Home 回到照片。": "Drag, scroll, or pinch to control the transition. Arrow keys move forward/back, Space plays/pauses, and Home returns to the photograph.",
  "三维场景暂时没有打开。你仍可以欣赏原照片。": "The 3D scene could not be opened. You can still enjoy the original photograph.",
